 And so I was looking at YouTube mini-series by someone called the Movie Rabbit Hole,

00:50:38.000 --> 00:50:46.000
 and they found out that, basically, films are using CGI to delete evidence of CGI

00:50:46.000 --> 00:50:48.000
 in the behind-the-scenes footage.

00:50:48.000 --> 00:50:50.000
 It's an amazing.

